    "voice": "special_communications/490170043/4901700430030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700430040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "枕元に置いておくのは大きいほうが\r\nいいかもしれないけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170043/4901700430040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700430050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "飾りなら、これくらいがちょうどいいかなって",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170043/4901700430050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700430060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……でも靴下なんだから、中に何か\r\nプレゼント入れた方がいいのかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170043/4901700430060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700430070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、あの……\r\nこれって飴とかいれても大丈夫ですか……？",
